# Mirror sync

This repo mirrors decks from `reactor-monte-carlo-guide` (`npm run
sync:upload-bundle` there). Never hand-edit deck physics here; fix upstream and
re-sync. When BEAVRS or example decks change upstream, this mirror and its
README provenance note must be refreshed in the same session.
